  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, post exchange initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reduce gender-based violence, empower women &amp; girls in 4 rural villages through awareness, counseling, and sustainable community leadership. 600 women/girls, 600 men/boys educated on abuse recognition, rights, and support services through 4 social campaigns. 2 girls&apos; toilets constructed, improving school attendance &amp; dignity. 2 Safe Centers developed to counsel &amp; train girls. 20+ survivors receive counseling/ access to legal/social support. 4 Saathi Leaders + 40 peer members serving as local change agents. Functional referral networks connecting survivors to legal, health, and social services.</narrative>
  </description>
